{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2023-01-26 16:17:00', 'title': 'NISOURCE INCREASES COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND AND DECLARES PREFERRED STOCK DIVIDEND', 'text': 'MERRILLVILLE, IND. , JAN. 26, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF NISOURCE INC. (NYSE: NI) TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF 25 CENTS PER SHARE, PAYABLE FEBRUARY 17, 2023 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON FEBRUARY 7, 2023.'}